the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int -\\frac{\\sqrt{e+1}}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{e+1}\\int -\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{e+1}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186526079 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166769 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "24e9c062-13d1-5a36-ad70-f062f3765100" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Using Arcsch"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1417af30-2fe4-5f7c-927e-664f92fa8417" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{8}+\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186525248} {:answer/id #uuid "50d9dbe2-acce-57f8-b889-2c446b8dbdc5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{8}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186525415} {:answer/id #uuid "6a52e174-f096-5581-b120-3f4827fd2763" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{8}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186525478} {:answer/id #uuid "97623fd8-8a69-584e-8e2a-1ce602bfaec8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{8}+\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186525595} {:answer/id #uuid "b284b77a-563d-5bb2-8125-83da409a6da3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}({x}^{8}-\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186525664}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6a52e174-f096-5581-b120-3f4827fd2763" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{8}